docs {
  # Team - Export Excel

  Downloads an `.xlsx` of the reports the user can see (drafts excluded) — an HOD gets
  their own employees, SuperUser / Admin get everyone, anyone else gets an empty file.
  Max **93 days** per export. Pass `empId` to export one employee (the **Export** button on
  the Employee summary screen does this).

  ## Query
  | Param | Notes |
  |---|---|
  | `from`, `to` | `YYYY-MM-DD`, default last 30 days |
  | `dept` | Optional department filter |
  | `empId` | Optional single employee |

  `scope=me` (export my own reports) is **refused with 403** — employees have no history.

  ## Sheets
  - **Reports** — Date, Emp ID, Name, Dept, Type, Status, Tasks, Effectiveness (0-10), Late, Blockers, Submitted At
  - **Task Entries** — Date, Emp ID, Name, Dept, Slot, Task, Details

  In Bruno, use **Save Response** to store the file.
}
